<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">01/03/2021: Rescinding Prior Executive Orders, </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/Utah-Executive-Order-No.-2020-76.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Executive Order No. 2020-76,</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> [published 01/15/2021]</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="e1043-e44 x-acc-item" id="2020"><button id="tab-e1043-e44" class="x-acc-header" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="panel-e1043-e44" data-x-toggle="collapse" data-x-toggleable="e1043-e44" type="button"><span class="x-acc-header-content"><span class="x-acc-header-indicator"><svg class="icon-expand-circle-down" viewBox="0 0 33.334 33.334">   <g>     <path d="M16.667,22.209l7.292-7.334-1.959-1.916-5.333,5.291-5.333-5.291-1.959,1.916,7.292,7.334Zm0,11.125c-2.278,0-4.4307-.4377-6.458-1.313-2.028-.8747-3.799-2.069-5.313-3.583-1.514-1.514-2.7083-3.285-3.583-5.313-.8753-2.0273-1.313-4.18-1.313-6.458,0-2.3053,.4377-4.472,1.313-6.5,.8747-2.028,2.069-3.792,3.583-5.292s3.285-2.6873,5.313-3.562c2.0273-.8753,4.18-1.313,6.458-1.313,2.3053,0,4.472,.4377,6.5,1.313,2.028,.8747,3.792,2.062,5.292,3.562s2.6873,3.264,3.562,5.292c.8753,2.028,1.313,4.1947,1.313,6.5,0,2.278-.4377,4.4307-1.313,6.458-.8747,2.028-2.062,3.799-3.562,5.313-1.5,1.514-3.264,2.7083-5.292,3.583-2.028,.8753-4.1947,1.313-6.5,1.313Zm0-2.792c3.8613,0,7.139-1.3473,9.833-4.042,2.6947-2.694,4.042-5.9717,4.042-9.833s-1.3473-7.139-4.042-9.833c-2.694-2.6947-5.9717-4.042-9.833-4.042s-7.139,1.3473-9.833,4.042c-2.6947,2.694-4.042,5.9717-4.042,9.833s1.3473,7.139,4.042,9.833c2.694,2.6947,5.9717,4.042,9.833,4.042Z"/>   </g> </svg></span><span class="x-acc-header-text">2020</span></span></button><div id="panel-e1043-e44" role="tabpanel" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="tab-e1043-e44" data-x-toggleable="e1043-e44" data-x-toggle-collapse="1" class="x-collapsed"><div class="x-acc-content"><div class="x-text x-content e1043-e45 msz-16 msz-17 msz-1e msz-1f msz-1g"><p><span>Downloads and opens as a PDF. Executive documents of this time period are archived and available for reference, research, or recordkeeping.</span></p>

<ul>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">11/25/2020: Calling the Sixty-Third Legislature Into the Tenth Extraordinary Session, </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/Utah-Proclamation-No.-2020-10E.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Proclamation No. 2020-10E,</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> [published 12/15/2020]</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">11/12/2020: Temporary Statewide COVID-19 Restrictions, </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/Utah-Executive-Order-No.-2020-75.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Executive Order No. 2020-75,</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> [published 12/01/2020] (NOTE: this order supersedes Utah Executive Order No. 2020-74.)</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">11/09/2020: Temporary Statewide COVID-19 Restrictions, </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/Utah-Executive-Order-No.-2020-74.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Executive Order No. 2020-74,</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> [published 11/15/2020] (NOTE: this order supersedes Utah Executive Order No. 2020-73.)</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">11/08/2020: Temporary Statewide COVID-19 Restrictions, </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/Utah-Executive-Order-No.-2020-73.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Executive Order No. 2020-73,</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> [published 11/15/2020]</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">11/08/2020: Declaring a State of Emergency Due to Rising COVID-19 Case Counts Creating a Shortage of Hospital Beds, </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/Utah-Executive-Order-No.-2020-72.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Executive Order No. 2020-72,</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> [published 11/15/2020]</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">11/03/2020: Wildland Fire Management, </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/Utah-Executive-Order-No.-2020-71.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Executive Order No. 2020-71, </span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">[published 11/15/2020]</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">10/20/2020: Calling the Sixty-Third Legislature Into the Ninth Extraordinary Session, </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/Utah-Proclamation-No.-2020-9E.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Proclamation No. 2020-9E, </span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">[published 11/01/2020]</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">10/01/2020: Wildland Fire Management, </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/Utah-Executive-Order-No.-2020-70.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Executive Order No. 2020-70, </span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">[published 10/15/2020]</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">09/29/2020: Extending the Suspension of Enforcement of Statutes Relating to Telehealth Services, </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/Utah-Executive-Order-No.-2020-69.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Executive Order No. 2020-69, </span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">[published 10/15/2020]</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">09/25/2020: Temporarily Extending the Suspension of Enforcement of Statutes Relating to Telehealth Services, </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/Utah-Executive-Order-No.-2020-68.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Executive Order No. 2020-68, </span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">[published 10/01/2020]</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">09/19/2020: Temporarily Reauthorizing the Suspension of Enforcement of Statutes Relating to Telehealth Services, </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/Utah-Executive-Order-No.-2020-67.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Executive Order No. 2020-67, </span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">[published 10/01/2020]</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">09/19/2020: Temporarily Reauthorizing the Suspension of Enforcement of Utah Code Section 32B-5-309 Regarding Ceasing Operation of Certain Retail Licensees, </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/Utah-Executive-Order-No.-2020-66.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Executive Order No. 2020-66, </span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">[published 10/01/2020]</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">09/19/2020: Temporarily Reauthorizing the Suspension of Enforcement of Provisions of the Utah Postretirement Reemployment Restrictions Act, </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/Utah-Executive-Order-No.-2020-65.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Executive Order No. 2020-65, </span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">[published 10/01/2020]</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">09/19/2020: Temporarily Reauthorizing the Suspension of Utah Administrative Code R671-302 Regarding Public Access to Board of</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Pardons and Parole Hearings, </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/Utah-Executive-Order-No.-2020-64.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Executive Order No. 2020-64, </span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">[published 10/01/2020]</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">09/19/2020: Declaring a State of Emergency Due to the Ongoing COVID-19 Pandemic, </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/Utah-Executive-Order-No.-2020-63.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Executive Order No. 2020-63, </span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">[published 10/01/2020]</span></li>
